ight":180},"detail":"Two rounds of classic horror soundtracks with Nikki in charge. £5 cash, and dressing up is encouraged.","cta_label":"Save your seats →"},{"url":"https://www.the-anchor.pub/events/halloween-events-near-me-monster-mash-the-anchor-halloween-party-2026-10-31","date":"Sat 31 Oct","name":"House of Horrors Halloween Party","image":{"alt":"Enter If You Dare, the House of Horrors Halloween party at The Anchor","src":"https://tfcasgxopxegwrabvwat.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/event-images/events/d52cbd18-d293-4516-beca-e151eaa90180/square/branded/1788785717882-square-email.jpg","width":180,"height":180},"detail":"Free entry, fancy dress and the bar open until midnight. Come early if you want a good spot.","cta_label":"Let us know you''re coming →"}],"kicker":"What’s on","heading":"Three nights in October","all_events_url":"https://www.the-anchor.pub/whats-on"},"type":"whats_on_media"},{"data":{"rows":[{"bar":"4pm to 10pm","day":"Monday","closed":true},{"bar":"12pm to 10pm","day":"Tuesday","lunch":"12pm to 3pm","dinner":"4pm to 9pm"},{"bar":"12pm to 10pm","day":"Wednesday","lunch":"12pm to 3pm","dinner":"4pm to 9pm"},{"bar":"12pm to 10pm","day":"Thursday","lunch":"12pm to 3pm","dinner":"4pm to 9pm"},{"bar":"12pm to 10pm","day":"Friday","lunch":"12pm to 3pm","dinner":"4pm to 9pm"},{"bar":"12pm to 10pm","day":"Saturday","kitchen":"12pm to 7pm"},{"bar":"12pm to 10pm","day":"Sunday","kitchen":"1pm to 6pm"}],"heading":"When we''re open","footnote":"Last orders are 30 minutes before the kitchen closes and 15 minutes before the bar does. The clocks go back on Sunday 25 October, but our hours don''t change."},"type":"opening_hours_week"},{"data":{"rows":[{"date":"Sat 31 Oct","note":"Full menu 12pm to 6pm, kitchen shut 6pm to 9pm, then pizza only","hours":"12pm to midnight"}],"heading":"One date is different","footnote":"Halloween is the only date in October that differs from the week above. Pizza from 9pm is available to eat in or to take away."},"type":"opening_hours_dates"},{"data":{"cards":[{"url":"https://www.the-anchor.pub/book-table","body":"Carved fresh every Sunday, 1pm to 6pm. Nothing to order ahead, so you can decide on the day.","image":{"alt":"A Sunday roast at The Anchor in Stanwell Moor","src":"https://www.the-anchor.pub/images/food/sunday-roast/the-anchor-sunday-roast-stanwell-moor.jpg","width":258,"height":144},"heading":"Sunday roast","cta_label":"Book a table →"},{"url":"https://www.the-anchor.pub/christmas-parties","body":"The good dates go first. If you''ve a work do or a family table in mind, now''s the moment.","image":{"alt":"A Christmas dinner laid out at The Anchor","src":"https://www.the-anchor.pub/images/marketing/christmas-2026/christmas-dinner-hero.jpg","width":258,"height":146},"heading":"Christmas is booking","cta_label":"Christmas enquiries →"}]},"type":"grid_cards_linked"},{"data":{"body":["Sparks & Sparklers Quiz Night on Wednesday 4 November. Then Sequins & Showstoppers Music Bingo on Friday the 13th, and the Snowball Showdown on Wednesday the 18th. We''ll nudge you nearer the time."],"heading":"And when November comes"},"type":"text_block"},{"data":{"body":"Quiz team, fancy dress, or just a quiet pint by the fire. Whatever brings you in this month, we''d love to see you.","cta_url":"https://www.the-anchor.pub/whats-on","cta_label":"See what is on","phone_url":"tel:+441753682707","phone_label":"01753 682707","script_line":"See you this month","whatsapp_url":"https://wa.me/441753682707","whatsapp_label":"WhatsApp","reassurance_items":["Free parking right outside","Dogs welcome throughout"]},"type":"closing_panel_dark"},{"data":{"year":"2026","unsubscribe_url":"%%unsubscribe%%","privacy_notice_url":"https://www.the-anchor.pub/privacy-policy","reason_for_contact":"You are receiving this because you have booked with us before, or because you said you would like to hear from us. That may have been a while ago now, and we are glad you are still with us."},"type":"footer"}],"preheader":"Dar